ative advertising Getting informed ▪ Centralized Exchange (CEX) In 2024, Coinhouse identified five promising cryptos: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Polygon, Avalanche, and Cosmos. As the year comes to an end, it is time to evaluate their performances and look forward to 2025 to understand the future prospects of these digital assets. Why these 5 cryptos would have been the most promising in 2024? According to Coinhouse, these 5 cryptos were well positioned to be the most promising in 2024. What is the reality and what does 2025 hold? Bitcoin Two key elements were expected to propel Bitcoin in 2024: the approval of Bitcoin ETFs and the Bitcoin Halving 2024. These factors were supposed to boost demand and reduce supply, significantly increasing the value of BTC. A forecast that proved to be accurate as Bitcoin even exceeded expectations, reaching an all-time high of $105,000 in December 2024. For 2025, the leading crypto could fluctuate between $75,500 and $150,000, with bullish potential up to $180,000. Ethereum According to forecasts, several factors were expected to trigger a bull run for Ethereum in 2024. Firstly, the opening to DApps, then the approval of Ethereum ETFs , and finally major updates like Shanghai. These factors were intended to significantly enhance the adoption and value of ETH, helping the crypto to take off. Ethereum indeed kept these promises, reaching $4,001 in December 2024! ETH could continue to rise in 2025, projected to be between $3,105 and $5,701, with bullish potential reaching $5,888. Polygon The essential role of Polygon as a layer 2 solution for Ethereum, the availability of Polygon 2.0, and the migration of MATIC to POL , are factors expected to propel Polygon in 2024. Coinhouse analysts were correct, as Polygon indeed reached a peak of $1.28 in April 2024, before dropping sharply just after. The crypto currently sits around $0.61 with predictions ranging from $1.50 to $2.00 in 2025. Start your crypto adventure safely with Coinhouse This link uses an affiliate program. Avalanche For Avalanche to explode in 2024, several elements had to come together: the high performance of its platform for smart contracts, its turnkey technology for tokenizing real-world assets (RWA), and the arrival of registrations on its platform. These various elements were expected to foster the adoption of AVAX and significantly increase its value. This has indeed been the case, as the crypto’s price increased by 23.18% this year, and by 46.84% in the last month. With a current price of $47.14, Avalanche could reach ', timestamp=datetime.datetime(2025, 1, 9, 20, 1, 23, 217204), status='success', summary={'analysis_type': 'asset', 'assets': [{'ticker': 'BTC', 'rating': 'Buy - Strong demand catalysts such as ETF approval and halving.', 'target_price': '$75,500 to $150,000, potential up to $180,000', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['Bitcoin ETF approval', 'Bitcoin Halving 2024'], 'kpis': ['All-time high of $105,000 in December 2024'], 'action': 'Add Long', 'sources': ['Coinhouse']}, {'ticker': 'ETH', 'rating': 'Buy - Benefiting from DApps expansion and ETF approval.', 'target_price': '$3,105 to $5,701, potential up to $5,888', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['Opening to DApps', 'Ethereum ETF approval', 'Major updates like Shanghai'], 'kpis': ['Reached $4,001 in December 2024'], 'action': 'Add Long', 'sources': ['Coinhouse']}, {'ticker': 'MATIC', 'rating': 'Hold - Awaiting further developments post-migration.', 'target_price': '$1.50 to $2.00', 'sentiment': 'Neutral', 'catalysts': ['Polygon 2.0 availability', 'Migration of MATIC to POL'], 'kpis': ['Peaked at $1.28 in April 2024'], 'action': 'Maintain Position', 'sources': ['Coinhouse']}, {'ticker': 'AVAX', 'rating': 'Buy - Strong platform performance and RWA tokenization.', 'target_price': 'Not specified', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['High performance of its platform for smart contracts', 'Turnkey technology for tokenizing real-world assets', 'Registrations on its