 ensure to carry out due diligence. About Brand Press : This is a sponsored content service, enabling brands to directly engage with our technology-focused audience. Please note that Brand Press content is created independently of Techpoint Africa's editorial team. Interested in reaching our dynamic readership? Connect with us at business@techpoint.africa With Bitcoin ($BTC) recently dipping below the $90,000 level in what many are calling “the final flush,” those in the know are seeing echoes of pre-bull market January 2021. Back then, BTC tumbled nearly 25% to $30,000, shaking out paper hands, only to surge a mind-blowing 130% to a new all-time high in February and then November. Fast forward to January 2025 and history is repeating itself, but this time, the stage is set for something far more monumental. The catalyst? Donald Trump’s inauguration as the 47th U.S. President. With news breaking that Trump is expected to issue pro-crypto executive orders on his very first day in office, according to The Washington Post , a tidal wave of optimism has already started sweeping through the crypto world. From proposed tax cuts on capital gains to rolling back anti-crypto regulations, the market is expecting an explosion of liquidity amidst greater adoption that could send crypto valuations skyrocketing. Therefore, crypto investors realize this is the moment to position themselves for life-changing returns as billions of dollars are ready to flood into the market . Altcoins and memecoins, often overlooked during Bitcoin’s dominance phase, are primed to soak up 9-figure worth of capital inflows as BTC stabilizes and investors rotate into higher-reward assets during the altcoin season. So, what’s the best crypto to buy now to transform modest investments today into millionaire-level portfolios 6-12 months from now on? Our comprehensive time-sensitive research has identified five standout projects that are primed for explosive growth in the 2025 crypto bull run. Among the fr