n January | Top 10 Cryptocurrencies to Buy this Month', content="Best Crypto Coins to Buy in January | Top 10 Cryptocurrencies to Buy this Month Events Get Featured Advertise About Us Search for: Events Get Featured Advertise About Us Subscribe To Techpoint Digest Digest Subscription Email First Name JOIN FREE Mode Techpoint Digest Fintech Governance & Policy Crypto Attend Pitch Friday Brand Press Crypto Brand Press Best Crypto Coins to Buy in January | Top 10 Cryptocurrencies to Buy this Month January 6, 2025 · 5 min read This Brand Press post is for informational purposes only and should not be interpreted as financial or investment guidance. Always ensure to carry out due diligence. About Brand Press : This is a sponsored content service, enabling brands to directly engage with our technology-focused audience. Please note that Brand Press content is created independently of Techpoint Africa's editorial team. Interested in reaching our dynamic readership? Connect with us at business@techpoint.africa The crypto community is buzzing about the best crypto coins to buy in January 2025. Solana (SOL), Filecoin (FIL), JetBolt (JBOLT), Internet Computer (ICP), Mantle (MNT), Dogecoin (DOGE), Bitget (BGB), Tron (TRON), Chainlink (LINK), and Hedera (HBAR) are the current top-trending coins this month because of the blockchain features and market performance they exhibit. Interestingly, new presale altcoin JetBolt (JBOLT) is catching the attention of whales with its explosive showing with over 230 million tokens sold since its presale launch, as well as its invigorating zero-gas technology and other groundbreaking features. What makes Solana, Filecoin, JetBolt, Internet Computer, Mantle, Dogecoin, Bitget, Tron, Chainlink, and Hedera the top ten cryptocurrencies to buy this month? Continue reading to find out. Best Crypto Coins to Buy in January: A Quick Roundup JetBolt (JBOLT): A young token revolutionizing zero-gas technology and innovative Web3 features. Solana (SOL): A high-performing blockchain notable for its scalability and energy efficient ecosystem. Filecoin (FIL): A blockchain that offers incentives for data storage providers. Internet Computer (ICP): Known for its integration with other blockchains and smart contracts called canisters. Mantle (MNT): A Layer 2 scaling solution for Ethereum that uses Optimistic Rollup technology. Top 10 Cryptocurrencies to Buy this Month: A Deep Dive JetBolt (JBOLT) New altcoin, JetBolt (JBOLT) , is bringing a breath of fresh air in the robust world of blockchain with zero-gas technology and presale soaring to over 230 million tokens sold. JetBolt eliminates the gas fees and is built on the Skale Network, which could prove to be an advantage for users and developers working on DeFi, blockchain gaming, and other NFT projects. Through its SocialFi system, JetBolt rewards users when they stake their tokens and interact on the platform, elevating the usual staking process. Meanwhile, token buyers can get up to 25% more tokens when they purchase Alpha Box packages or tokens in batches. With its presale perks, a growing number of crypto buyers and whales are captivated by JetBolt. READ MORE Solana (SOL) Price Gains 14.2% This Month as Crypto Whales Buy Up This New Coin Mirroring its futuristic lightning cat mascot, JetBolt provides lightning-fast with instant finality transactions, thus hastening the blockchain interaction process. JetBolt also aggregates blockchain news and content with the use of an AI-aggregation tool, categorizing these stories and trends based on bullish or bearish market sentiment. The list of JetBolt’s strong suits doesn’t end here. JetBolt incorporates fresh innovation into its crypto wallet, featuring WebAuthN and face ID recognition. As it continues to gain momentum, JetBolt continues to be named as one of the best crypto coins to buy this 2025. Solana (SOL) Currently changing hands at $214.87, Solana declined by 0.74% in the last 24 hours and 8.75% this month. Contradicting the dips, SOL rose by 12.15% over the past seven days. This top-", timestamp=datetime.datetime(2025, 1, 28, 14, 18, 12, 607399), status='success', summary={'analysis_type': 'asset', 'assets': [{'ticker': 'JBOLT', 'rating': 'Buy', 'target_price': 'N/A', 'sentiment': 'Bullish', 'catalysts': ['Zero-gas technology', 'Presale success with over 230 million tokens sold', 'Integration with Skale Network', 'SocialFi system rewarding user engagement'], 'kpis': ['Presale volume: 230 million tokens', 'Potential up to 25% bonus with Alpha Box packages'], 'action': 'Add Long', 'sources': ['Techpoint Africa']}, {'ticker': 'SOL', 'rating': 'Hold', 'target_price': 'N/A', 'sentiment': 'Neutral', 'catalysts': ['High scalability and energy efficiency', 'Recent 12.15% price gain over seven days'], 'kpis': ['Current price: $214.87', 'Price change: -0.74% in 24 hours, -8.75% this month'], 'action': 'Maintain Position', 'sources': ['Techpoint Africa']}]}, agent_id='680e5f00-7f68-47d7-b257-3498095fd366', extraction_method='selenium'), WebSearchResult(url='https://coindcx.com/blog/cryptocurrency/top-10-cryptos-2025/', title='Attention Required! | Cloudflare', content='Attention Required! | Cloudflare Please enable cookies. Sorry, you have been blocked You are unable to access coindcx.com Why have I been blocked? This website is using a security service to protect itself from online attacks. The action you just performed triggered the security solution. There are several actions that could trigger this block including submitting a certain word or phrase, a SQL command or malformed data. What can I do to resolve this? You can email the site owner to let them know you were blocked. Please include what you were doing when this page came up and the Cloudflare Ray ID found at the bottom of this page. Cloudflare Ray ID: 908fa21cfd8e988e • Your IP: Click to reveal 2400:1a00:b050:ef3b:fc35:7ec2:79de:d522 • Performance & security by Cloudflare', timestamp=datetime.datetime(2025, 1, 28, 14, 18, 17, 24